<html lang='en' style='margin:0;padding:0;'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>New Feature: Daily Match Predictions - KickerGPT</title>
    <style>
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          margin: 0 !important;
          border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;"
  >
    <table
      role='presentation'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      width='100%'
      style='background:#f5f7fb;padding:32px 0;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center'>
          <table
            role='presentation'
            class='email-container'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            width='640'
            style='width:640px;max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;'
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;'
              >
                <div
                  style='font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111827;'
                >
                  KickerGPT
                </div>
                <div
                  style='margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;'
                >
                  Football intelligence
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:28px 32px 18px;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;'
              >
                <p style='margin:0 0 12px;'>Hey {{name}},</p>
                <p style='margin:0 0 16px;'>
                  We're excited to introduce a brand new feature that takes
                  match analysis to the next level!
                </p>

                <div style='margin:20px 0;'>
                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-size:32px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;'
                    >🎯 Daily Match Predictions</div>
                    <div style='font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;'>
                      Get high-confidence match outcome predictions powered by
                      advanced algorithms analyzing bookmaker odds, team form,
                      head-to-head history, injuries, news sentiment, and more.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #10b981;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >✨ How It Works</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      Our AI analyzes multiple factors for each match:
                      <ul
                        style='margin:8px 0 0 20px;padding:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'
                      >
                        <li>Bookmaker odds and implied probabilities</li>
                        <li>Recent team form and momentum</li>
                        <li>Head-to-head historical performance</li>
                        <li>Key player injuries and availability</li>
                        <li>News sentiment and team morale</li>
                        <li>Home advantage factors</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >📊 Free vs PRO Access</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      <strong>Free users:</strong>
                      Get up to
                      <strong>5 high-confidence predictions</strong>
                      per day<br />
                      <strong>PRO users:</strong>
                      Get
                      <strong>all predictions</strong>
                      with unlimited access
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#fef3c7;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >⚡ Updated Daily</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      Predictions are generated fresh every day at midnight, so
                      you always have the latest insights for today's matches.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div
                  style='margin:24px 0;padding:20px;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;text-align:center;'
                >
                  <div
                    style='color:#1e40af;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;'
                  >
                    Ready to see your predictions?
                  </div>
                  <a
                    href='{{appUrl}}'
                    target='_blank'
                    rel='noopener'
                    style='display:inline-block;padding:12px 32px;background:#3b82f6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;'
                  >
                    View Predictions
                  </a>
                </div>

                <p style='margin:20px 0 6px;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                  Thanks for being part of the KickerGPT community!
                </p>
                <p style='margin:0;font-weight:600;'>The KickerGPT Team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;'
              >
                <p style='margin:0 0 8px;'>
                  You're receiving this email because you requested access to
                  KickerGPT.
                </p>
                <p style='margin:0 0 12px;'>
                  Need help? Reply to this email and we'll get back ASAP.
                </p>
                <a
                  href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'
                  style='color:#4b5563;text-decoration:underline;'
                  target='_blank'
                  rel='noopener'
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>